<title>Digital Assistance - Mauli Enterprises</title>

<style>
body {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #f1f5fb;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 20px;
}
.container {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: auto;
}
.card {
    background: white;
    padding: 20px;
    border-radius: 12px;
}
pre {
    background: #101827;
    color: white;
    padding: 15px;
    border-radius: 8px;
